  "claim": "Acoustic is an EP by an Canadian rock band. Mathew James \"Matt\" Willis has more top 20 singles than that band.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Matt Willis. Sentence: Mathew James \"Matt\" Willis (born 8 May 1983), also previously known as Mattie Jay, is an English singer-songwriter, television presenter and actor, best known as the bassist and one of the vocalists of the pop punk band, Busted.\nPage: Matt Willis. Sentence: Willis released his debut solo album \"Don't Let It Go to Waste\" on 20 November 2006, which included three top 20 singles.\nPage: Bayside (band). Sentence: Bayside is an American rock band from New York City, formed in 2000, currently consisting of lead vocalist/guitarist Anthony Raneri, lead guitarist Jack O'Shea, bassist Nick Ghanbarian, and drummer Chris Guglielmo.\nPage: Acoustic (Bayside EP). Sentence: Acoustic is an EP by American rock band Bayside, released on February 28, 2006.",
